      "id": "G4",
      "description": "It is not specified whether the original Document Reviewer re-checks the document after revisions are made by the Document Author."
    },
    {
      "id": "G5",
      "description": "There is no defined maximum number of revision cycles or escalation path if the Feature Owner repeatedly finds revisions unacceptable."
    },
