      "description": "The format and structure of the specification document and feature change list are unspecified, which affects the feasibility of automated comparison and linting."
    },
    {
      "id": "G7",
      "description": "Reviewer assignment — how a specific Document Reviewer is selected or notified for a given document version — is not specified."
    }
  ]
